      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Ivanti Neurons Agent connects endpoints to the Neurons platform. You can assign policies automatically with rules, install manually using a policy and enrollment key, or push-install from an existing deployment-capable agent; for example, push install sends the agent to selected target devices. Key terms: Agent Policy — endpoint configuration; Enrollment Key — registers an agent; APA — rule-based policy assignment; Deployment capability — lets an installed agent deploy to others; credentials — elevated-access details.",
